# Build output: rebuilt by windows/build.ps1 and mac/build-mac.sh.
rust/target/
mac/dist/

# Your own data never belongs in here: the API key lives in the config file
# under %LOCALAPPDATA%\freespeak (Windows) or
# ~/Library/Application Support/freespeak (macOS), outside this folder.
*.log

# The Windows installer IS committed on purpose, so a clone can be installed
# without a toolchain: windows/dist/FreeSpeakSetup.exe
